      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've noticed some different issues with positional audio too. For example, if you go to The Room of Rain map, put a video on the video player, and then stare at the wall with all the settings on it, you will only hear the video's audio playing in your left ear, and nothing on your right. Same thing if you faced the opposite way.",
