      "value": "I've experienced this bug very often in The Pug. and have since seen it occur to others in front of me; About 5 or so people in front of me teleported about 5 meters adjacent all at the same time. I thought this behavior odd, so upon further investigation, all 5 people reported to have lost positional audio sync. after telling them what I saw no one ever reported being teleported and two people told me they did not experience a teleportation. promptly their after all of them restarted their clients and/or disconnected.",
