      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name}: it isn't happening to me anymore, but i have heard the occasional user complain about it, very rarely. I do know some headsets (og vive comes to mind) also get stereo swapped globally and not just in VRC, and I have no way of knowing if thats what those individuals are experiencing. The issue i had in 2020 is likely unrelated to any current ones.",
