  "details": "New to the audio update of this week, there seem to be situations where the audio channels swap for other voices (left voices in right ear etc) permanently. Requires client restart to fix (so not a SteamVR reboot!). Have attempted loading into other worlds/avatars afterwards, bug remained.\n\nSteps to reproduce (not entirely certain): \nLoading into the following world, and after a certain amount of time/interactions the bug occurred: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_d93d97b3-7e68-492d-b929-4c1fb26ccd9e\n\nUpdate: Bug is also headset invariant, occurred on Index/Vive/Rift so far.",
